@page "/Account/RegisterConfirmation"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Check your email</PageTitle>

<h1>Check your email</h1>

@* Same message whether or not the address is registered, so this page can't be used to find
   out who has an account. The template's on-screen confirmation link was removed: it let
   anyone confirm any address without access to its inbox. *@
<p role="status">
    If that address can be used for a new account, we've sent it a link to confirm it.
    Open the link to finish creating your account. It may take a few minutes to arrive, so check
    your spam folder too.
</p>
<p><a href="Account/ResendEmailConfirmation">Didn't get it? Resend the confirmation email</a></p>
